            {
                "entry_id": "a4371f6e-cde8-309d-a778-ea4afef06854",
                "word": "torve",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c93d4f35-3306-4ec9-851f-b047e25b57ba",
                        "entry_id": "a4371f6e-cde8-309d-a778-ea4afef06854",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "torves"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac5f6be1-d37a-34b2-b2a4-66b4f11d1c63",
                        "entry_id": "a4371f6e-cde8-309d-a778-ea4afef06854",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sournois et menaçant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bf510f2-f498-46ec-b2fb-37d854511357",
                                "sense_id": "ac5f6be1-d37a-34b2-b2a4-66b4f11d1c63",
                                "text": "Ses yeux torves roulaient des lueurs fauves sous des cheveux en broussailles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ca06db8-4299-4207-a5bd-e7e5a5f5d1f5",
                                "sense_id": "ac5f6be1-d37a-34b2-b2a4-66b4f11d1c63",
                                "text": "Ce n'était pas une fumerie d'opium mais un assommoir comme ce quartier torve en compte des centaines."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3db79d09-6443-4efa-9934-22bf037eea7d",
                                "sense_id": "ac5f6be1-d37a-34b2-b2a4-66b4f11d1c63",
                                "text": "Ils avaient l’air si misérables, si puants, la plupart de mes clients, si torves aussi, que je me demandais toujours où ils allaient les trouver les vingt francs qu’il fallait me donner, et s’ils n’allaient pas me tuer en revanche."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1971b69a-8295-4384-8c43-3c8babeaeab5",
                                "sense_id": "ac5f6be1-d37a-34b2-b2a4-66b4f11d1c63",
                                "text": "et le vent soufflant dans les ruelles étroites s’en prenait torve et violent\naux contrevents du village d’eaux sous un ciel de laine grise"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "305cbd7e-b5a3-376f-8094-f593f016fce3",
                        "entry_id": "a4371f6e-cde8-309d-a778-ea4afef06854",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Oblique, tordu."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "842da544-ba67-4ff3-9e3f-628bc5e96352",
                                "sense_id": "305cbd7e-b5a3-376f-8094-f593f016fce3",
                                "text": "Quasimodo portait la tête torve."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fffaa7c5-4c31-4d5c-99dd-c1f53232d9b0",
                                "sense_id": "305cbd7e-b5a3-376f-8094-f593f016fce3",
                                "text": "Il n’apercevait aucun changement, sinon qu’une lueur de ruse était dans les yeux, et que la ride torve de l’hypocrisie s’était ajoutée à la bouche !…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4176344d-b405-471f-91cd-2a5f0abb3fce",
                                "sense_id": "305cbd7e-b5a3-376f-8094-f593f016fce3",
                                "text": "Et après cela il restait encore à traîner et rouler sur le sol vers les tas les grosses souches arrachées, à grand renfort de reins et de bras raidis et de mains souillées de terre, aux veines gonflées, qui semblaient lutter rageusement avec le tronc massif et les grosses racines torves."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2edaeca0-080e-378f-86a1-ad11845ea0f1",
                        "entry_id": "a4371f6e-cde8-309d-a778-ea4afef06854",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualifie le regard atteint de strabisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30d35af9-a62e-4a2d-969e-63b051ba75be",
                        "source_entry_id": "a4371f6e-cde8-309d-a778-ea4afef06854",
                        "target_lang_word": "grim",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "grim",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fd471b3-97fa-36ea-8b1f-051ac7e5968b",
                                        "entry_id": "c532479f-4c72-363d-85ca-fdaa481a1a18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dismal and gloomy, cold and forbidding."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5afc0739-c493-4ae2-b4d2-ad660628caac",
                                                "sense_id": "1fd471b3-97fa-36ea-8b1f-051ac7e5968b",
                                                "text": "Life was grim in many northern industrial towns."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb17dbdc-0aa1-43de-97bf-17af6f4e3a04",
                                                "sense_id": "1fd471b3-97fa-36ea-8b1f-051ac7e5968b",
                                                "text": "Developments were markedly different in the Soviet zone, but ultimately ended in perhaps an even grimmer dead end: that of SED leader Walter Ulbricht’s thoroughly Stalinized German Democratic Republic (GDR)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5acfc2fd-2a18-4eaa-9e3f-6edeebeca095",
                                                "sense_id": "1fd471b3-97fa-36ea-8b1f-051ac7e5968b",
                                                "text": "Cristiana Paşca Palmer, the executive secretary of the UN Convention on Biological Diversity, said the destruction of the world’s biggest rainforest was a grim reminder that a fresh approach needed to stabilise the climate and prevent ecosystems from declining to a point of no return, with dire consequences for humanity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dfa66e7-069b-4f2f-bb15-da8d01c5a065",
                                                "sense_id": "1fd471b3-97fa-36ea-8b1f-051ac7e5968b",
                                                "text": "It's been a grim start to the year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c90a02cc-6a06-375e-baa3-b8dffab5f117",
                                        "entry_id": "c532479f-4c72-363d-85ca-fdaa481a1a18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rigid and unrelenting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a476a096-f0fb-409c-aa2b-4daa441eb19f",
                                                "sense_id": "c90a02cc-6a06-375e-baa3-b8dffab5f117",
                                                "text": "His grim determination enabled him to win."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfd792f8-948d-3ea4-ba11-b92f364162d6",
                                        "entry_id": "c532479f-4c72-363d-85ca-fdaa481a1a18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ghastly or sinister."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4316cd7b-67b0-436e-9d7b-1124bb02ee4e",
                                                "sense_id": "dfd792f8-948d-3ea4-ba11-b92f364162d6",
                                                "text": "A grim castle overshadowed the village."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3eedba5b-0ad6-482b-96d6-34769c8000af",
                                                "sense_id": "dfd792f8-948d-3ea4-ba11-b92f364162d6",
                                                "text": "There was, I thought, a trace of very profound and very genuine irony in the timbre—not the flashy, meaninglessly jaunty pseudo-irony of the callow \"sophisticate,\" which Derby had habitually affected, but something grim, basic, pervasive and potentially evil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2db5134c-8fbc-4041-abe6-0e2637d68b7d",
                                                "sense_id": "dfd792f8-948d-3ea4-ba11-b92f364162d6",
                                                "text": "In movie terms, it suggests Paul Verhoeven in Robocop/Starship Troopers mode, an R-rated bloodbath where the grim spectacle of children murdering each other on television is bread-and-circuses for the age of reality TV, enforced by a totalitarian regime to keep the masses at bay."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f49d3db1-d003-39fc-aa4e-59028049a748",
                                        "entry_id": "c532479f-4c72-363d-85ca-fdaa481a1a18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Disgusting; gross."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9234d73-3113-4989-a142-7940fe77c42a",
                                                "sense_id": "f49d3db1-d003-39fc-aa4e-59028049a748",
                                                "text": "– Wanna see the dead rat I found in my fridge?\n– Mate, that is grim!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0da3c8c-54d2-4229-b17e-ad7a0f9c0156",
                                                "sense_id": "f49d3db1-d003-39fc-aa4e-59028049a748",
                                                "text": "Whenever I find myself growing grim about the mouth; whenever it is a damp, drizzly November in my soul; whenever I find myself involuntarily pausing before coffin warehouses, and bringing up the rear of every funeral I meet; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "518a77e1-d173-3d85-9be3-1959d21d52fd",
                                        "entry_id": "c532479f-4c72-363d-85ca-fdaa481a1a18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fierce, cruel, furious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
